RAG stands for Retrieval Augmented Generation

RAG grounds LLM responses in actual documents reducing hallucination

RAG Architecture

User Query
Retrieval (find relevant docs, embedded docs/vector store)
Context + Query (for combined prompt)
LLM
Response

RAG Chain:
Documents
   ↓
Chunking
   ↓
Embeddings
   ↓
Vector DB
   ↓
Retriever
   ↓
LLM (Qwen/Llama)
   ↓
Structured Answer

